{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is close, take it, check properties, do task. If not, move or search. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = SearchForObject    />\"",
